  "description": "Marine VHF receive-only profile for U.S. lower-band voice, DSC, and ship-side channels that fit inside one RTL-SDR capture window centered near Channel 16. NOAA weather, AIS, and upper duplex coast-side frequencies need another capture window or profile.",
